window.products.push({"id":1098130,"name":"nestl Duvet Cover with Fitted Sheet 4 Piece Set - Soft Double Brushed Microfiber Hotel Collection - Comforter Cover with Button Closure, Fitted Sheet,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I1SG4-OFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Wake Up to a Brighter Tomorrow The search is over! Say goodbye to restless, sweaty nights and usher in a new era of peaceful, refreshing sleep.Our luxurious bedding is tightly woven and double brushed on both sides, contributing to a silky soft feel and ensuring that our 100% microfiber bedding is softer and more durable than Egyptian cotton sheets or high thread count cotton sheets! Pet Friendly No worries about pet nails and claws! Our bedding is less likely to tear or snag, even when you share your bed with your pets. So go ahead, build a pillow fort and snuggle inside with your best friend.Lightweight, breathable and cool to the touch, our dreamy, soft bedding will create an unforgettable sleeping experience! Easy use and care Protect your favorite down comforter, alternative down comforter, blanket or duvet with a duvet cover. Simply slip the duvet cover over your comforter and secure each corner with the attached ties to keep the comforter in place.The duvet cover fastens with large, clear buttons which are easier to use, less likely to come undone and blend in seamlessly.We created Nestl to bring you soft, beautiful bedding at fair prices. As pioneers at the forefront of the bedding industry, we are proud to present you with affordable,high-quality bedding, crafted from premium microfiber material and made to last. Nestle between our silky soft bedding for a sleep so sublime, you’ll wonder if you’re dreaming!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81I1SG4-OFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestl","source_asin":"B07MFZMXNK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MFZMXNK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MFZMXNK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098131,"name":"Vorshape Wooden Spice Rack Organizer for Kitchen Cabinet or Wall Mount - Space Saving Set of 3 Hanging Spice Racks Floating Shelves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GSTYK0oIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Rustic Spice Shelves】Simply designed with solid paulownia wood and industrial matte metal brackets and guardrail, the artificial charcoal firing makes the texture healthy and odorless. An easy match with rustic, vintage, modern and more styles to design a look for your kitchen. Three same length boards allow you to plan the layout you need, our floating spice shelves are an amazing choice if you need extra storage space or if you want to get some visual enjoyment in the space. 【Comprehensive Protection Design】The surface of the metal frame adopts the spraying powder ink process, which not only has a good-looking appearance but also prevents rust. Unique three-sided guardrail design, which can better prevent the things on the shelf from falling. Each shelf is 0.7 inches thick and can bear 22Ib. These wall shelves deliver attractiveness, durability, and heavy-duty utilization. 【Only Two Steps Installation】Each half-assembly wooden shelf has pre-drilled holes, use 2 screws to fix the metal guardrail to the board, and then use the other 2 screws to fix the shelf to the wall. Back mounting brackets made shelves truly floated! Attached accessories and installation instructions, you can assemble in minutes. 【Versatile & Functional】Wall shelf can not only be placed spices or condiments in the kitchen, also placed in the bedroom or bathroom to place beauty/hair products, installed in a long corridor to show family photos, showcase trophies and honors by the fireplace. The rustic wall shelves will add a retro style to your bedroom, bathroom, living room, office or more. 【WHAT YOU GET】A set of 3 half-assembly wooden spice shelves with 3 metal guardrails, 12 screws, 1 leveler, and 1 instruction sheet. MEASURE: 16 x 3.5 x 4.2 inches. BTW, These solid shelves must be an ideal gift for displaying collectibles, photos, books, artworks and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GSTYK0oIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vorshape","source_asin":"B08R3JHQP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R3JHQP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R3JHQP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
