window.products.push({"id":1098328,"name":"AIDENOEY 3-in-1 1.8L Electric Heating Lunch Box, High power 75W, Removable 304 Stainless Steel Container Lunch Box Larger capacity, 12V/24V/110V Food ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hBvSnQQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The newest electric lunch box: new appearance design, four colors for you to choose. We use silicone pull ring, the common style on the market is to use plastic handle is very easy to break. Meanwhile, our lid has two notches for cutlery, one more than other models. We also designed a vent where the gas in the lunchbox automatically wafts out to cool it down. Ensure that you can eat your own healthy food every day, which makes your life and body healthier and saves you the trouble of heating it up in the microwave and other tools. PTC Ceramic Fast Heating technology: Whether you are at home or in the car or at work, our heated lunch box allows you to eat beautiful warm food in the fastest time. Our heated lunch box is a 75W high power heating system, faster than the market common 60W power, can save your time to the greatest extent. We've tested it multiple times and it's at least 10 minutes faster than any heated lunch box on the market. The electric lunch box can be used in office, home (110V), car (12V), truck (24V) and other scenarios. Large capacity provides adequate and balanced food: most heated lunch boxes are 1.5L, while ours are 1.8L. Larger capacity allows you to have more food choices, allows you to get more nutrition, provides sufficient motivation to study, play or work, etc. At the same time, we also have a small sub-box, so you have room for fruit and vegetable salad, etc., to make your meal a healthy combination. Safe and reliable to carry & large capacity leak-proof design: In order to better seal, the internal silicone sealing ring and oblique trapezoidal buckle structure design around the side, the sealing effect can be up to IP68, so there is no need to worry about liquid food spilt in the shaking environment.Strong sealing can ensure the freshness and temperature of the food, can be kept fresh in the refrigerator or transportation, can ensure that the temperature of the food will not be lost quickly, and ensure that the food is still delicious. Easy to clean stainless steel material: We use 304 stainless steel material, ensure that the lunch box heating faster, less time, but also let the overall weight of the heating box, convenient for you to carry. Best of all, the heated lunch box is easy to clean after eating, the stainless steel container can be removed separately, and the heated lunch box is made of special materials, not easy to stain with oil, easy to clean. We strictly control the quality of our products. We are happy to support our products and provide one-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hBvSnQQ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDENOEY","source_asin":"B0BXKKZ1XJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXKKZ1XJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXKKZ1XJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
