window.products.push({"id":1098361,"name":"4TH Emotion Christmas Tree Throw Pillow Cover Farmhouse Decor Cushion Case for Sofa Couch 18x18 Inches Linen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jLhAH7dBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Polyester PACKAGE INCLUDES: Christmas pillow cover, No Insert or Filler.Pattern is only on the front and no printing on the back. (4TH Emotion pillow cover can help you to change christmas decorations quickly. also a super cute gift for your family and friends.) SIZE: This pillow cover fits 18x18 inch insert, PLEASE NOTE: All of our pillow covers are made to ensure a snug fit. Each listing size refers to the pillow insert size and not the pillow cover size. To ensure the proper fit, we make all pillow covers slightly smaller (approximately 0.5\" smaller) than the insert size. EASY TO PUT ON: Color-coordinated hidden zipper closure brings an elegant appearance, and it’s super easy to stuff pillows/fillers into this pillow covers. WASHING TIPS: Machine wash in cold water separately, gently cycle only, dot not bleach. MATERIAL: Made of 100% Polyester linen, soft and skin-friendly, no fading or abrasion, can be used outdoors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jLhAH7dBL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"4TH Emotion","source_asin":"B0B9S4RHD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9S4RHD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9S4RHD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098362,"name":"BANDQ Soil Moisture Meter, Soil PH Meter/Light/Moisture Meter for House Plants, Gardening Farm Lawn Test Kit Orange PH Meter BANDQ-04 0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bcM7n3yPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BATTERIES INCLUDED IN THE PACKAGE 4IN1 SOIL METER MULTIFUNCTION SOIL TEST KIT 4-IN-1 Soil Moisture Meter Design to be lightweight and portable, easy to carry around, apply for both indoor and outdoor use, idea soil test kit for house plants, garden, lawn and farm. Kindly Note: 1. Don't use soil meter to test water. This soil meter can not be used to test ph/moisture value of any liquid. 2. PH tester non-lab grade. Test a few more positions or adjust the test sensor until the value changes. 3. Don't push it too hard, and if the soil is too dry, please water it before testing. 4. Do not leave the soil meter in the soil after testing plants in the garden or pot. 5. Please clean test soil tester after each use. Package: 1 x 4in1 Soil Meter (Soil Moisture Tester/Soil Temperature/Sunlight Tester/Soil PH Tester) 4 x AAA Batteries Included 1 x Packing Box Question: If I just measure soil moisture, do I need to wait 10 minutes before readings? Answer: The soil moisture meter can be read instantly, you can read it when the needle of the dial stop change. You don't need to wait ten minutes. Question: Do soil moisture meters test accurate moisture and pH values in water? Answer: The multi-function soil meter is specially designed for soil testing, and it is not recommended to test in water to obtain accurate moisture or ph values.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91bcM7n3yPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BANDQ","source_asin":"B0B5GYJMQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5GYJMQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5GYJMQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098363,"name":"Whole Home Humidifier,15-13/16 in. H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H5pZhRCFL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Aprilaire Automatic Humidifier Model 600 takes humidifier innovation to the next level and performs as good as it looks! It offers all of the performance benefits of our other technologically-advanced computer-equipped automatic humidifiers and it’s easier than ever to have installed because it includes a built-in bypass damper, which means fewer parts to install. Plus, the damper is conveniently labeled for summer and winter settings, allowing you to set it for the entire season with no guesswork involved. Just set it and let your humidifier run automatically and it will deliver up to 50% more humidity, compared to other competitive units on the market. It also can be installed in manual mode if needed. The Model 600 has an evaporative capacity of .70 gallons per hour and is ideal for a home with up to 4,000 square feet if it’s tightly constructed. We believe it’s the best performing bypass humidifier on the market! Plenum opening size is 9 3/4\"W X 12 1/2\"H. The unit housing is reversible for right, or left-hand installation orientation. Included with unit: * 1 installed # 35 Water Panel * Self-piercing saddle valve * # 56 automatic humdistat with outdoor sensing bulb * 110VAC to 24VAC transformer * Installation instructions/plenum cut-out template * Owners Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31H5pZhRCFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aprilaire","source_asin":"B000JM5CMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000JM5CMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000JM5CMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098364,"name":"Department 56 \"Tallyho!\" Set of 5 Retired","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8bPNcICL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introduced in 1995 and retired in 1998. Set of 5. These hand painted porcelain pieces are part of the Dickens’ Village Series. In the country, aristocracy ride horses for the sport of following scent hounds as they pick up the trail of a fox. Jumping hedges and fences, they ride the countryside, guided by the Whipper-in who sounds the tallyho.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t8bPNcICL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B001F6QHN2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001F6QHN2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001F6QHN2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
