window.products.push({"id":1098366,"name":"Waverly Grand Bazaar 4-Piece Queen Comforter Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KGHyMWxVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Grand Bazaar Comforter Set is crafted of 100-Percent cotton and woven to create a gently textured, soft hand. Each set includes one reversible comforter, one tailored bedskirt and two coordinating pillow shams. Reversible comforter offers a transitional versatility with designs inspired by period motifs from the Ottoman Empire reversing to an ethnic collage of medallions and paisley. The design comes to life with rich jewel tones of burnt orange, fern green and deep burgundy accented by neutral shades of clay and cream. Comforter and shams are finished with decorative grosgrain ribbon trim. Designs from the reversible comforter adorn the coordinating accessories. Coordinating window treatments include a pair of curtain panels with tiebacks and valance. Complete your bedroom retreat with coordinating window treatments. Hang two curtain panels and a valance with decorative tiebacks for complete window ensemble. Each panel offers easy-to-hang rod-pocket or back-tab for your choice of hanging options. Scalloped window valance features an all-over Ottoman inspired design of florals and leaves in rich jewel tones. Lovely contrasting vertical stripe insets make this valance a must-have. Each window valance offers a 3'' rod-pocket with 2'' decorative topper. Gather valance for desired top affect. Enhance the ensemble by layering on the coordinating european sham with decorative ribbon trim. No bedroom oasis is complete without delicately embellished accent pillows. The Waverly Grand Bazaar Collection offers a lovely 18'' square embroidered pillow with zipper closure, 20'' square pillow with mitered stitching and covered button, 20'' square pillow with stacked pleats and a 14'' oblong pillow with double-sided french tie closures. The queen comforter measures 92'' x 96''. The king comforter set measures 110\" by 96\". Queen set ships with two standard shams. King set ships with two king shams. Tailored bed skirt offers a deep 15\" drop. Imported. Accessories sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1KGHyMWxVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAVERLY","source_asin":"B007VY7XB2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007VY7XB2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007VY7XB2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098367,"name":"Nuwave Infinity Noise Reduction Blender, Sealed Sound Enclosure, Professional Grade, Digital Controls, 56oz Tritan Jar, Laser-Cut Stainless-Steel -Bla","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":166.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iVtDJCz5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE BLENDER: Featuring 6 program buttons and 10 adjustable manual speeds perfect for smoothies, frappes, frozen drinks, spreads, salsas, sauces, nut butters, and much more. The self-cleaning feature can clean thoroughly within 30 seconds. MULTIPLE SAFETY PROTECTIONS: 56 Oz Tritan Jar made of TX1001 material, BPA-Free, non-breakable, and safe for mother and baby; Professional grade blender for shakes and smoothies and built to last a lifetime. Your safety is fully guaranteed. EXPLOSIVE BLENDER FOR KITCHEN: Built-in laser-cut stainless-steel blades to handle the toughest ingredients; 2.5 HP high-end motor, the high-speed can reach up to 17,000 RPM even with a full-load, releasing nutrients while providing a more delicate taste. DOUBLE NOISE REDUCE BLENDERS: The 5.5mm thick enclosure, soundproof cover designed effectively to blocks stirring noise and provides a comfortable cooking environment, can effectively reduce 40% of the noise. INTERTEK LAB TESTED: Lab torture test proves that Infinity Blender can withstand more than 15,000 cycles of continuous blending. Each cycle consisted of filling the jar with water, blending for 3 minutes, then draining. That’s over 45,000 minutes of blending. THE LAST SMOOTHIE BLENDER YOU'LL EVER NEED – Infinity Blender has proven that it can blend over 100 years of worth without slowing down. Enjoy the peace of mind with a 10-year warranty. Blend worry-free for many decades to come. LASER-CUT STAINLESS-STEEL BLADES - The patent pending stainless-steel blades are laser cut to precise angles to be sharp, thin & strong. The blades are engineered to slice more efficiently while creating less oxidation for a smoother, creamier blend. DIGITAL CONTROLS - The intuitive control dial and tactile buttons combined with the digital LCD display make it easy for virtually anyone to blend delicious drinks with the press of a button. There is even an on/off switch on the side for emergencies. BLENDER FOR EVERY OCCASION – Whether you’re a workout warrior looking for a protein shake maker; a bartender looking for the perfect margarita blender; or a restaurant or commercial kitchen; Infinity can handle your workload with ease. WHAT’S INCLUDED – Infinity Blender power base; 56 oz Tritan jar; Tritan sound dampening detachable enclosure; 1 plunger; 1 owner’s manual and recipe book.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iVtDJCz5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nuwave","source_asin":"B0C37H9S4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098367","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C37H9S4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C37H9S4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
