window.products.push({"id":1098487,"name":"Hives and More Cypress J NUC Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFNFcu5rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This new NUC box was made for Jesse Kasem Azam, owner of S&S Apairies LLC in Edgewater, FL, who wanted a Nuc box that had good ventilation and that was stackable for shipping. Our box is made of Cypress for long life and does not need to be painted. The top comes in Cypress with two wood cleates on each end and no feeder hole or a MDO Plywood top with a standard feeding hole. Both have a dado cut around the edges to keep tops from sliding off the box. Depth of frame ledge has been increased to 7/8\" to allow for our dodo cuts in tops and when the tops are turned over to the flat side there is an extra 3/8\" space for feeding. Bottom is screened for ventitalition and has wood strips over exposed screen edges to help when handling from the bottom. There are 3/4\" wood spacers made of Cypress attached to the bottom for ventilation when stacked or shipped. All joints are glued and stapled. A small wood wedge comes with the Jnuc to either close the box or used as a entrance reducer to restrict the 4\" opening. The JNuc Box holds 5 standard deep Hive Body frames (not included). American made in North Florida by a family owned company, specializing in producing woodware for beekeepers in Cypress and Pine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oFNFcu5rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hives and More","source_asin":"B00HOIAYLQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HOIAYLQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HOIAYLQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
