window.products.push({"id":1098507,"name":"PERLESMITH Floating Wall Mounted Shelf Double AV Shelf with Strengthened Tempered Glasses for DVD Players,Cable Boxes, Games Consoles, TV Accessories ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Kxi+iCeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UPGRADED DURABLE TV SHELF: Our floating wall shelf is built with two large strengthened tempered glass shelves and sturdy steel, which provide more space for DVD Players/router/CDs/Blu-ray players/Projector and cable boxes/remotes/game consoles/speakers and so on. COMPATIBILITY & LOAD CAPACITY: This wall mounted shelf is compatible with wood studs, concrete wall, brick wall and drywall. Our floating tv shelf can hold up to 16.5 lbs of each shelf. This wall mount shelf allows you to place multiple AV components on it without any worries. EASY HEIGHT ADJUSTMENT & INSTALLATION: The adjustable floating shelf ensures that your unit is mounted at the perfect height. The floating tv shelf comes with an easy-to-use Instruction manual for quick and easy installation with fittings provided. Install the TV shelf without any hassle. SAVE SPACE & CABLE MANAGEMENT: The floating wall shelf free up your floor space and organize your entertainment center better in your living room, bedroom, game room or office. Cable management function of the cable box shelf keep your cables and accessories organized and neat. FRIENDLY CUSTOMERS SERVICE: We always offer friendly customer service. We provide standard mounting hardware with the wall mount shelf to make the installation as easy and convenient as possible. If you have any problems please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618Kxi+iCeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PERLESMITH","source_asin":"B07MBXGJM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MBXGJM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MBXGJM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098508,"name":"SHYFOY Mirrored Floating Wall Shelf with Crystal Crushed Diamond Inlay, Decorative Wall Mounted Shelf for Bedroom/Bathroom/Living Room, Luxury Display","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GkaWYTVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUILT TO LAST - This mirrored wall shelf is made of sturdy medium-density fiberboard (Artificial wood) and HD silver mirror. High-quality engineered support rod add stability and strength to this crystal floating wall shelf, ensuring long-lasting uses.The silver display shelf can hold up to 22lbs. CONCEALED SUPPORT & EASY INSTALL - The support design that extends into mirror wall shelf is strong and hide the bracket well, achieving a simple and beautiful decorative effect. Easy to mount, bling crystal shelf comes with all mounting screws you will need for setting up the whole piece.Installation can be completed within 15 minutes following our standard installation instructions SOPHISTICATED ART DECOR STYLE - Unlike traditional mirrored shelf that look old and outdated, our glamorous hanging shelf is filled with crushed diamond crystals. Sparkly and stand out from your wall, also giving you more space. MODERN DESIGN - This shine fireplace trophy shelf offers a remarkable touch of originality and modernity to your wall; fits to all rooms and even office wall decor; books, CDs, DVDs, trinkets, cups, photos, or plants can be placed here. PERFECT GIFT FOR HOMEOWNERS - Can't think of a suitable gift for a close friend or loved one? Our decorative crushed diamond wall mounted shelf makes an excellent present for housewarming parties, weddings, thanksgiving and Christmas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GkaWYTVzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHYFOY","source_asin":"B0C61KW9VS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C61KW9VS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C61KW9VS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1098509,"name":"Zassenhaus 3-Piece Mortar and Pestle Set, Cast Iron Grinder Set for Spices and Seeds, Large, 3-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.6,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KzjBbjw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-PIECE HERB & SPICE GRINDER SET: This Mortar and Pestle Set features a cast iron construction that won’t absorb flavors, and an extra bowl so you can grind multiple ingredients faster. This convenient set lets you grind herbs, seeds, and spices quickly, making food prep a breeze! CREATE TRADITIONAL, AUTHENTIC DISHES: The mortar and pestle are ancient food prep accessories used in traditional Mexican, Indian, and Italian cooking. By using this set to crush your fresh spices or herbs, you can create more authentic dishes with traditional textures, flavors, and aromas. QUALITY CAST IRON SPICE GRINDER: This mortar and pestle set is very stable and made to last. The pestle is long and heavy for a comfortable grip. The large mortar measures 2.4\" H x 2\" D x 3.5\" dia. and the small mortar is 1.8\" H x 1.3\" D x 3\" dia. EASY TO CLEAN: This traditional food prep tool is easy to clean and easy to care for. Simply handwash the set with tap water and wipe completely dry immediately after washing. Do not wash this cast iron grinding set in the dishwasher. ZASSENHAUS TRADITION: Founded in 1867, Zassenhaus has become the epitome of high quality spice and coffee mills, as well as many other useful, high quality kitchen tools. They combine classic timeless style with reliable functionality and innovative design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KzjBbjw1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Zassenhaus","source_asin":"B01B4S3V6G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01B4S3V6G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01B4S3V6G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
