window.products.push({"id":1098813,"name":"Scott Living Lewis 100% Cotton Hygro Jacquard 6-Piece Towel Set | Abstract Rainy Day Gray | Soft & Absorbent | Designer Home Towels | Sustainable | 2 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lFvHKhZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"After renovating houses for hundreds of families, hosts of HGTV’s “Property Brothers” Drew and Jonathan Scott know how to make a home work for everyone – and that includes high-quality home furnishings, textiles and décor that look great and fit your needs. Scott Living by Drew & Jonathan reflects their commitment to help you create the perfect space for the people you love. With the Scott Brothers’ latest collection featuring modern and nature-inspired patterns, you’re sure to make a statement. A DESIGNER LOOK TO LOVE in a 100% HygroCotton bath towel. Made to last, these 580 GSM weight towels absorb quickly, become softer and fluffier wash after wash, adding a luxurious staple to the bathroom. Set features an elegant geometric jacquard design. Modern color options paired with white include rich brown, golden ochre or neutral tan will update any bathroom. This six piece set includes: 2 Bath Towels (30” x 54”) each, 2 Hand Towels (16” x 30”) each. Two Wash Cloths (13” x 13”) each. MUST HAVE FEATURES, Our contemporary bath towels are constructed for everyday performance with added designer home luxury. Wrap up in plush softness crafted in hollow-core yarns. This revolutionary spinning technology allows towels to absorb more, so they dry faster. CAREFULLY DESIGNED, Scott Living home products are better for you, your family, and the planet. Our products are Oeko-Tex Made in Green Certified. They have met high environmental safety standards and are tested for harmful substances. Our sustainable products are manufactured under environmentally friendly and socially responsible working conditions. Our recycled cotton textiles feature sustainably sourced fibers that are environmentally friendly as cotton fibers are naturally biodegradable. EASY CARE, Wash before use. Machine wash warm with like colors. Gentle cycle. Use non-chlorine bleach when needed. Avoid use of fabric softener. Tumble dry low. Do not iron. Do not dry clean. We stand by our product and offer a 30-DAY \"LOVE-IT\" GUARANTEE, \"We're not happy unless you're happy\". We recommend for an added polished look, pair or gift with other Scott Living luxury home products. Each sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lFvHKhZrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Living","source_asin":"B09NM5VFXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1098813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NM5VFXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NM5VFXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
